%% Automated QA Pipeline Workflow
flowchart TD
    Start(["Developer / CI: npm run verify"]) --> Step1["1. TypeScript Check<br/>tsc --noEmit"]
    Step1 -->|Pass| Step2["2. Static Content & A11y Audit<br/>tsx scripts/audit/runAudit.ts"]
    Step1 -->|Fail| Abort1["Abort: Type Errors Found"]

    Step2 -->|Pass| Step3["3. Automated Test Suite<br/>vitest run"]
    Step2 -->|Fail| Abort2["Abort: Broken Links / Missing Metadata"]

    Step3 -->|Pass| Step4["4. Dual-Entrypoint Production Build<br/>npm run build"]
    Step3 -->|Fail| Abort3["Abort: Unit/Integration Failures"]

    Step4 -->|Pass| Step5["5. Bundle & Manifest Inspection<br/>tsx scripts/inspect/inspectBundle.ts"]
    Step4 -->|Fail| Abort4["Abort: Vite Compilation Error"]

    Step5 -->|Pass| Success(["Verification Complete: Exit 0<br/>All Artifacts & Quality Checks Green"])
    Step5 -->|Fail| Abort5["Abort: Missing Entrypoints / Corrupt Manifest"]
